<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>Then the prop behind the band coalesced for her. A three-metre figure, a man from the knees up with arms folded across a bare chest, looked over the band. He was wearing nothing but a pair of pink boxer shorts depicting fairy motifs.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'91Mr Fairy Boxers!\'92 Sarah laughed, then choked, and cried a little.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>After a small emotional meltdown, Sarah slept like a baby, the kind of baby who knew she had lost her way a bit lately\'97and sure life had been bowling her some googlies lately, but nevertheless, this baby would be in charge again. First thing in the morning.
